---
import "../styles/global.css";

import SeoHead from "../components/SeoHead.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<SeoHead title="Documentary & Brand Films Perth | Smooth Corner Studio" description="Documentary films, brand stories and video production in Perth and regional Western Australia. Explore people-led filmmaking by Smooth Corner Studio." path="/films" preloadImage="/images/generic-background-5.webp" />
	</head>

	<body>
		<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
		<header class="page-header">
			<a class="back-link" href="/#work">Back to Smooth Corner Studio</a>
		</header>

		<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
			<div class="portfolio-stage">
			<section class="project-hero">
				<div class="project-shell">
					<p class="eyebrow">Films</p>
					<h1 class="display-title">Thoughtful films with a human eye.</h1>
					<p class="hero-copy">
						Documentary films, brand stories and video production in Boorloo / Perth and regional
						Western Australia. I like films that feel honest, warm and alive: planned
						properly, but still leaves enough room for real people, quiet details, strange
						little moments and the feeling of being there.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section craft-section">
				<div class="project-shell story-grid">
					<h2 class="display-title">A story first approach.</h2>

					<div class="text-stack">
						<p>
							For me, filmmaking starts before the camera comes out. It starts with the feeling:
							what the story should carry, who it is for, where it needs to live and what should
							stay with people after they watch it.
						</p>

						<p>
							The work sits somewhere between documentary, brand film and visual storytelling.
							It is considered and well shaped, but not too polished. I am interested in real
							voices, natural light, texture, rhythm, atmosphere and the small details that make
							a place or person feel specific.
						</p>

						<p>
							That might be a short film for a project, a social piece with a bit more care, a
							brand story, an event film, or a small portrait of a person doing something they
							care about. The goal is always to make something useful, honest and a little more
							memorable than a standard promo video.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="project-section video-section">
				<div class="project-shell">


					<div class="video-grid">
						<article class="video-card">
							<h3 class="visually-hidden">Loinnir</h3>
							<button
								class="video-placeholder video-poster"
								type="button"
								data-youtube-id="2elP5uCIB9c"
								data-youtube-title="Loinnir"
								aria-label="Open Loinnir film"
							>
								<img
									src="/images/films/loinnir.webp"
									alt="Loinnir — an interview being filmed in a sunlit room" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="/images/films/loinnir-480w.webp 480w, /images/films/loinnir-800w.webp 800w, /images/films/loinnir-1200w.webp 1200w, /images/films/loinnir.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 850px) calc(100vw - 76px), 543px" />
							</button>
							<p>
								Loinnir is a film shaped around atmosphere, rhythm and the small details that linger.
								A considered piece of visual storytelling, with room for quiet moments and a feeling
								that stays beyond the final frame.
							</p>
						</article>

						<article class="video-card">
							<h3 class="visually-hidden">Pathway to Purpose</h3>
							<button
								class="video-placeholder video-poster"
								type="button"
								data-youtube-id="9BHvhDwwQFo"
								data-youtube-title="Pathway to Purpose"
								aria-label="Open Pathway to Purpose film"
							>
								<img
									src="/images/films/pathway-to-purpose.webp"
									alt="Pathway to Purpose — trainees and mentors with motorcycles at sunset" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="/images/films/pathway-to-purpose-480w.webp 480w, /images/films/pathway-to-purpose-800w.webp 800w, /images/films/pathway-to-purpose-1200w.webp 1200w, /images/films/pathway-to-purpose.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 850px) calc(100vw - 76px), 543px" />
							</button>
							<p>
								A short documentary following young Aboriginal people, mentors and trainers in the
								Aboriginal Pastoral Academy. Filmed across the Kimberley, it explores Country,
								culture, confidence and the pathways taking shape through pastoral work.
							</p>
						</article>

						<article class="video-card">
							<h3 class="visually-hidden">Soulty Sisters</h3>
							<button
								class="video-placeholder video-poster"
								type="button"
								data-youtube-id="mKWNz7GBMqY"
								data-youtube-title="Soulty Sisters short film trailer"
								aria-label="Open Soulty Sisters short film trailer"
							>
								<img src="/images/films/soulty-sisters-project.webp" alt="Soulty Sisters — women gathering beside the ocean" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="/images/films/soulty-sisters-project-480w.webp 480w, /images/films/soulty-sisters-project-800w.webp 800w, /images/films/soulty-sisters-project-1200w.webp 1200w, /images/films/soulty-sisters-project.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 850px) calc(100vw - 76px), 543px" />
							</button>
							<p>
								A film shaped from event footage, still images and raw voice notes, capturing the
								soul of Soulty Sisters: warmth, confidence, community and women finding themselves
								in the water.
							</p>
						</article>

						<article class="video-card">
							<h3 class="visually-hidden">Carers for Land and Sea</h3>
							<button
								class="video-placeholder video-poster"
								type="button"
								data-youtube-id="BUcQZa4VlrQ"
								data-youtube-title="Carers for Land and Sea"
								aria-label="Open Carers for Land and Sea video"
							>
								<img src="/images/films/carers-land-sea.webp" alt="Carers for Land and Sea — a researcher tending plants in a greenhouse" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="/images/films/carers-land-sea-480w.webp 480w, /images/films/carers-land-sea-800w.webp 800w, /images/films/carers-land-sea-1200w.webp 1200w, /images/films/carers-land-sea.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 850px) calc(100vw - 76px), 543px" />
							</button>
							<p>
								A purposeful video for the Department of Primary Industries and Regional Development,
								explaining who DPIRD is, what it does and why its work matters across Western
								Australia.
							</p>
						</article>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			</div>

			<div class="video-modal" id="video-modal" aria-hidden="true" inert>
				<div class="video-modal-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Video player">
					<button class="video-modal-close" id="video-modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close video">×</button>
					<iframe
						id="video-modal-iframe"
						title="Selected film"
						allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
						allowfullscreen
					></iframe>
				</div>
			</div>

			<section class="project-section cta-section">
				<div class="project-shell cta-card">
					<p class="eyebrow">Have something in mind?</p>
					<h2 class="display-title">Let’s shape the story properly.</h2>
					<p class="cta-copy">
						Tell me what you are making, where it needs to live and what kind of feeling you want it to carry.
					</p>
					<a class="button primary" href="/#contact">Start a conversation</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<SiteFooter afterSection />
		<script>
			import { createModalController } from "../scripts/modal";
			const videoPosters = document.querySelectorAll("[data-youtube-id]");
			const videoModal = document.querySelector("#video-modal");
			const videoModalIframe = document.querySelector("#video-modal-iframe");
			const videoModalClose = document.querySelector("#video-modal-close");

			const modalController = createModalController(videoModal, videoModalClose);

			const openVideoModal = (poster) => {
				if (!videoModal || !videoModalIframe) return;
				const videoId = poster.getAttribute("data-youtube-id");
				const videoTitle = poster.getAttribute("data-youtube-title") || "Selected film";
				if (!videoId) return;

				videoModalIframe.src = `https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/${videoId}?autoplay=1&rel=0&modestbranding=1`;
				videoModalIframe.title = videoTitle;
				modalController.open();
			};

			const closeVideoModal = () => {
				if (!videoModal || !videoModalIframe) return;
				modalController.close();
				videoModalIframe.src = "";
			};

			videoPosters.forEach((poster) => {
				poster.addEventListener("click", () => openVideoModal(poster));
			});

			videoModalClose?.addEventListener("click", closeVideoModal);

			videoModal?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
				if (event.target === videoModal) {
					closeVideoModal();
				}
			});

			document.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
				if (event.key === "Escape") {
					closeVideoModal();
				}
			});
		</script>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	body {
		background: var(--ink);
		color: var(--cream);
	}

	.page-header {
		position: fixed;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		z-index: 10;
		width: 100%;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 22px clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px);
		background: rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.42);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 234, 220, 0.18);
		border-radius: 0 0 68px 68px;
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--sand);
		font-size: 0.84rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.project-shell {
		width: min(100% - 40px, 1180px);
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.project-hero {
		position: relative;
		isolation: isolate;
		min-height: 86vh;
		display: grid;
		align-content: center;
		padding: 180px 0 96px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border-radius: 0 0 68px 68px;
		background:
			linear-gradient(
				90deg,
				rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.9),
				rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.56) 52%,
				rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.28)
			),
			url("/images/generic-background-5.webp") center center / cover no-repeat;
	}

	.project-hero .eyebrow,
	.section-heading .eyebrow,
	.cta-card .eyebrow {
		font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.2vw, 1.05rem);
	}

	.project-hero h1 {
		max-width: 980px;
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--sand);
		font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 10rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.015em;
		line-height: 0.88;
		padding-left: 0.04em;
		text-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);
	}

	.hero-copy {
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 32px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 234, 220, 0.9);
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.7vw, 1.35rem);
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.project-section {
		padding: clamp(72px, 10vw, 130px) 0;
	}


	.craft-section {
		padding-top: clamp(45.54px, 6.325vw, 82.225px);
		padding-bottom: 0;
	}

	.portfolio-stage {
		border-radius: 0 0 68px 68px;
		overflow: hidden;
		background:
			radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 0%, rgba(122, 138, 133, 0.16), transparent 40rem),
			linear-gradient(145deg, #242d3b, #202628 70%, #1c1c1b);
	}

	.video-section {
		padding-top: clamp(45.54px, 6.325vw, 82.225px);
		position: relative;
		isolation: isolate;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.story-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: clamp(32px, 8vw, 100px);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.story-grid h2,
	.section-heading h2,
	.cta-card h2 {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--cream);
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7.5rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.015em;
		line-height: 0.9;
		padding-left: 0.04em;
	}

	.text-stack {
		display: grid;
		gap: 22px;
	}

	.text-stack p,
	.video-card p,
	.cta-card p {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgba(244, 234, 220, 0.78);
		font-size: 1.04rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}


	.section-heading {
		display: grid;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-bottom: clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px);
	}

	.video-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 18px;
	}

	.video-card {
		display: grid;
		gap: 18px;
		padding: 18px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(244, 234, 220, 0.18);
		border-radius: 28px;
		background: rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.42);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
	}

	.video-placeholder {
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		border: 1px solid rgba(244, 234, 220, 0.18);
		border-radius: 20px;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(215, 174, 129, 0.18), transparent 16rem),
			rgba(244, 234, 220, 0.05);
		color: var(--sand);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		text-align: center;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.video-poster {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		padding: 0;
		appearance: none;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.video-poster img,
	.video-image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		display: block;
		object-fit: cover;
		transition: transform 220ms ease, opacity 220ms ease;
	}

	.video-poster:hover img {
		transform: scale(1.025);
		opacity: 0.92;
	}

	.video-modal {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 100;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		padding: 24px;
		background: rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.78);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		opacity: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		transition: opacity 180ms ease;
	}

	.video-modal.visible {
		opacity: 1;
		pointer-events: auto;
	}

	.video-modal-card {
		position: relative;
		width: min(calc(100vw - 48px), 1120px);
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		overflow: visible;
		border-radius: 34px;
		background: rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.72);
		box-shadow: 0 28px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);
	}

	.video-modal-card iframe {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 0;
		border-radius: inherit;
	}

	.video-modal-close {
		position: absolute;
		top: -58px;
		right: 0;
		z-index: 2;
		width: 44px;
		height: 44px;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		border: 1px solid rgba(215, 174, 129, 0.42);
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 0;
		color: var(--sand);
		background: rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.64);
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		line-height: 1;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.cta-card {
		display: grid;
		gap: 22px;
		padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 64px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(244, 234, 220, 0.18);
		border-radius: 42px;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(215, 174, 129, 0.18), transparent 18rem),
			rgba(244, 234, 220, 0.04);
	}

	.cta-card p {
		max-width: 640px;
	}

	.cta-card .cta-copy {
		max-width: none;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.cta-card .button {
		width: fit-content;
		margin-top: 20px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 850px) {
		.portfolio-stage { border-radius: 0 0 48px 48px; }
		.page-header {
			padding: 14px 16px;
			border-radius: 0 0 48px 48px;
		}

		.project-hero {
			min-height: auto;
			padding: 170px 0 72px;
			border-radius: 0 0 48px 48px;
		}

		.project-hero h1 {
			font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 18vw, 6.8rem);
		}

		.story-grid,
		.video-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.video-modal {
			padding: 18px;
		}

		.video-modal-card {
			border-radius: 24px;
		}

		.video-modal-close {
			top: -56px;
			right: 0;
		}
		.cta-card .cta-copy {
			white-space: normal;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 850px) {
		.project-hero {
			background: linear-gradient(
				90deg,
				rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.9),
				rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.56) 52%,
				rgba(28, 28, 27, 0.28)
			),
			url("/images/generic-background-5-800w.webp") center center / cover no-repeat;
		}
	}
</style>
